 "result": "The final run confirms all four test modules (alpha, beta, gamma, delta) are passing \u2014 Click reported every shard current against the unchanged tree, with no failures.\n\nFixes, one per module:\n\n- `ledger/alpha.py` \u2014 `paginate` used `page * size` as the offset, skipping the first page; changed to `(page - 1) * size` for 1-based pages.\n- `ledger/beta.py` \u2014 `allocate` computed `leftover` but never distributed it, so shares didn't sum to the total; added the largest-remainder step (largest fractional part first, lower index wins ties, matching `[34, 33, 33]`).\n- `ledger/gamma.py` \u2014 `slugify` replaced each non-alphanumeric character with its own dash; the regex now matches runs (`[^a-z0-9]+`) so `\"Hello,  World!!\"` collapses to `hello-world`.\n\n`ledger/delta.py` was already passing and was left untouched, as was everything under `tests/`.\n\nFiles changed:\n- `ledger/alpha.py`\n- `ledger/beta.py`\n- `ledger/gamma.py`",
